{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"3c2fb2df7b6d04d350b59285237c28c1fdda7049cf969357c02b5a65fe809985","ja":"紬の不安","zh":"紬的不安","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"b70026e47f6cd48c9e5fe7553d547418aecdabdc1b003dd4cc54f26f0f068ea0","ja":"……ふぅ………………。","zh":"……呼………………。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"898bb85cf78fad0b2f58593cc4077ce12e375b087f84686c24938e0bd816b59b","ja":"お疲れさん……あれ？\n紬さん、難しい顔してどうしたんだい？","zh":"辛苦了……咦？\n紬小姐，脸色这么严肃是怎么了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"aa49c8b14f3b21ef419ec6ea445e49c865c47eecb53c519ff525f71c784eb6be","ja":"そ、そんな顔をしていましたか？\n一日署長の資料を読み込んでいただけなのですが……。","zh":"我、我露出那种表情了吗？\n我只是在仔细看一日警察署长的资料而已……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d0561ac6bdb8e764f9320cb5df34e1f9acadc7b2e5472cb1fab167bdd62201f3","ja":"交通安全教室の講師も行うので、\n交通ルールの教材といった資料が多くて。","zh":"因为还要担任交通安全课堂的讲师，\n所以像交通规则教材这类的资料很多。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"14127abb47944998ff3e9a4e1fcb460147a76567cc6da3fbb540edd851e14973","ja":"わぁ～、かっこいい！\n紬署長と紬先生になるんですね♪","zh":"哇～，好帅气！\n要变成紬署长和紬老师了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"cfd95170cd293924369653f76c6f9a1898802d9d4102f55eade6ca5bac63c9b5","ja":"そ、そうなりますね。\n務めを果たすため、しっかり勉強せんと。","zh":"是、是这样呢。\n为了履行职责，必须好好用功才行。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7c4066b915b83676288fc6b5fe5d464794324a6c56ec13ee4d46df06ac584a94","ja":"資料が書き込みでいっぱいになってる！\n紬さんはがんばりやさんだねぇ。","zh":"资料上写得满满当当的！\n紬小姐真的很努力呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"efa8099a79d55b913d9ab0dd8b50b236a640eae40de624635d6327f613fc342f","ja":"そ、それほどでも……。\n私なりに伝わりやすいようにできればと。","zh":"没、没有那么夸张啦……\n我只是希望能按自己的方式传达给大家。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"90546eeaeecb1a5d5ed4e996b70b7f928bb639c8abaab5a3183fec3344d67738","ja":"ですが、講師は不慣れなので、\nいくら準備しても不安で……。","zh":"但我还不习惯当讲师，\n无论做多少准备都觉得不安……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3e5400033b96dab650e38ef9ebb23a85f01d6b792aa742533d37adf62891c129","ja":"誰かに教えるのって、難しそうですね……。","zh":"教别人这种事，感觉挺难的呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0ecd8a34646c2f09586830d279396da4d687a377e1024d88f9d5e5d2e0e47aa2","ja":"あ！　それなら、今からリハーサルしてみませんか？\n私達が生徒役で！","zh":"啊！既然这样，要不要从现在开始彩排一下？\n我们来扮演学生！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f5f07e38c6fcb920802c72efd0ac1c58be7cffc6efda904d444609dc6296c9b9","ja":"そうだねぇ。紬さんのお手伝いができたら、\nあたしもうれしいべさ。","zh":"也是呢。要是能帮上紬的忙，\n我也很高兴呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"cad6e623c3358bdbf0d70965ce968ea4f84a7ff4fe1d57399b8655ea720c50f9","ja":"それは、とてもありがたいです。\nぜひ、お願いします！","zh":"那真是太感谢了。\n那就拜托您了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"3ef9d5d9914ec2e0aa4681dc54a74256726a85ef428b465eac38c84baa41d746","ja":"……こほん。では今から、交通安全教室を\n始めさせていただきます。一日署長の白石紬です。","zh":"……咳咳。那么现在，交通安全课堂就\n正式开始了。我是担任一日署长的白石䌷。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1657.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"5fe28eec5cfac4e7e25d6b003dd853336c2d78e7c8c7190e27e1fd5db91146b7","ja":"わ～！　パチパチパチパチ～♪\nがんばってください、紬さん！","zh":"哇～！啪啪啪啪～♪\n加油啊，紬小姐！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
